o =\n49\t  data.rfind(magic)` (\"final\"), parse the listed widths, verify bounds + hash; unspecified transform -> known-plaintext `HCFG`.\n50\t- **Location / storage as answer** -- `hcfg_offset` = decimal FILE offset (base64 -> the `S`, RAW -> the `H`); `overlay_offset` =\n51\t  the magic, `overlay_size` = len - offset; `hcfg_resource_size` = the u32le @+8 (380). `hcfg_storage` (D17 enum) in order:\n52\t  `base64` -> `raw_hcfg_section` -> `wasm_data_segment` -> `raw_const_array` (other native data section) -> `raw`.\n53\t- **Any other encoding -> `lib.binary.hcfg_scan(data)`** (hex/base32/85/UTF-16/reversed/xor/zlib/multibyte+rolling xor/byte maps/\n54\t  custom b64/split/int-array/strided/RC4/AES/TEA/ChaCha/stack-built); `hcfg_find` = first valid hit. Not the PK19 stub.\n55\t- **xor key / config VALUE SHAPES** -- crc, key byte and campaign/domain/mutex/url re-roll per variant. Timed modes change the\n56\t  SHAPE too: D23 campaign `BRNN-00V` -> `BRNN-<8 uppercase hex>`, d01 marker `BR01-CATALOG-00V` -> `BR01-<8hex>`, d01 FILE symbol\n57\t  `variant-000.c` -> `sample.c`; D24 also domain `node-00V.dayNN...` -> `<word>-<8hex>.dayNN.example.invalid` (word: sync/hub/\n58\t  core/mesh/relay/stage, D25-D26 also edge/cache/vault/proxy/node), mutex `Global\\HuntressBRNN_00V` -> `Global\\Huntress<12 uppercase\n59\t  hex>`, url `.../api/BRNN-00V` -> `https://<word>-<8hex>.dayNN.example.invalid/<word>/<10hex>` (path words vault/edge/stage/sync/\n60\t  gate); the url host word is independent of the domain word. Rule: copy values verbatim from the decoded JSON/symtab; never\n61\t  regex-check a value shape or key on `00V` indices.\n62\t- **Container per member** -- ELF vs PE32+ re-rolls per member in Mastery (d02, d04, d10 `pe`); labels from THIS member's header;\n63\t  dispatch on MAGIC (`7f454c46`, `MZ`, `PK`, `\\0asm`, next `NEKO`). PE symbol fields = COMDAT `.text$<mangled>`. Extensions lie\n64\t  about role, not container (D21 `.cmxs` = ELF ET_DYN).\n65\t- **Member qualifie